- 
Setup Environment Create the configuration file: cp .env.example .env 
- 
Prepare Script Make the initialization script executable: chmod +x init.sh 
- 
Start Services Run the stack in detached mode: docker compose up -d 
| Service | URL / Port | Description | 
|---|---|---|
| Admin Console | http://localhost:3002 | Management UI | 
| Core API | http://localhost:3001 | OIDC Provider | 
| PostgreSQL | localhost:5432 | Credentials in .env | 
- View Logs: docker compose logs -f app
- Stop & Remove: docker compose down
- Rebuild: docker compose up -d --build